(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ev-6"] = {"560801101":[["","Past the coast and around the checkpoint, as the morning light begins to rise, the outline of the harbor finally appears before the girl."],["Fia","So this is the smuggling port the middleman mentioned... Next, all I need to do is find that cargo and board the ship back to the Principality of Ovett."],["Fia","Father, Mother... I have waited far too long for this day."],["","Even after two years away, Fia still remembers the ice-free port of the Principality of Ovett. From the riverbank to the docks, everything is always bustling, operating tirelessly like gears in a well-oiled machine."],["","Now, however, the ground beneath her feet feels far more oppressive than the port she remembers. The vast dock holds only drifting glances and tense, uneasy shouts."],["","Every pair of eyes flickers with unsettling tension, as if searching for something—or fearing it."],["Foreman","Hey! You over there, why are you slacking off again?! This batch is an urgent shipment specifically ordered for Ovett. Move it!"],["Mover","These goods are... STs?! What big shot is smuggling these through our port? Who're they giving the slip?"],["Foreman","You're just a dockhand—why're you asking so many pointless questions? Shut up and watch the gate!"],["","On the other side of the port, the girl watches cautiously."],["Fia","Looks like that information broker really did set me up... The checks at this smuggling port are no less strict than the checkpoints outside."],["Fia","If these people catch sight of me... it will not end with a few questions and a warning."],["Fia","But even so, I can't back down... There's no turning back for me now."],["","The girl draws a deep breath and steels her resolve."],["","Timing the gaps between the cargo workers and using the shadow of the crane, Fia slips catlike into the narrow spaces between the containers."],["","But just as she is about to slip into the dockside warehouse, a shout rings out behind her. Dockworkers nearby hear it and begin gathering in small groups."],["Foreman","Hold it. Yeah, you—the sneaky little thing over there. Stop where you are!"],["Fia","......"],["Foreman","Well now, where did this dockhand come from, showing up to work in formal wear? Speak up. Who are you, and what are you doing here at the docks?!"],["Fia","(I have come this far... I cannot fail now!)"],["","Fia draws a breath and steadies herself."],["","She turns with quiet elegance, as though she stands once more at Helstota Manor in the Principality of Ovett, and casts a cold gaze at the foreman."],["Fia","Sneaking? Dockhand? Milkhama Island's hospitality proves just as barbaric as expected."],["Fia","Did the port manager not inform you that guests from the Principality of Ovett are visiting today?"],["Foreman","Ha! Now that is a good one. The boss only tells us to keep our eyes open—never said a word about any distinguished guests..."],["Foreman","Wait a moment... the boss did say we should keep a close watch... Could it be...?"],["","Perhaps sensing the girl's resolve, the foreman who had been so aggressive moments ago suddenly hesitates."],["","Seizing on that moment of doubt, Fia calmly reveals the family crest in her hand."],["","Though the Helstota family has long since declined, the ornate Ovett-style insignia still bears traces of its former prestige."],["Fia","I do not concern myself with whatever the manager told you."],["Fia","I only know that I have traveled all the way from the Principality of Ovett, only to be turned away at the gate and mistaken for some sneaking dockhand."],["Foreman","H-Hey now, this—this is all a misunderstanding!"],["Foreman","The higher-ups must have forgotten to inform us. I'll notify the manager right away so he can come take care of you. Please rest here for a while... and please don't take it to heart!"],["Fia","That will not be necessary. When a master inspects her own garden, she does not ask the gardener for permission."],["Fia","Besides, this shipment is of great importance. You would do better to return to your posts and attend properly to your duties."],["Fia","As for inspecting the port... I have my own arrangements."],["Foreman","Understood, understood, feel free to inspect. We won't disturb you."],["Foreman","You! And the rest of you! Stop crowding around—clear out! Don't get in the way of the young lady's inspection!"]],"560801301":[["","The moment Fia steps into the room, an indescribable pressure settles over her."],["","The tables, chairs, and decorations are arranged in a rigid Doll-style uniformity. The walls and floors are covered with exaggerated advertisements."],["","Every corner of the room brazenly proclaims the power of the Doll Group. Rather than a girl's chamber, it resembles the forward outpost of a commercial empire."],["Alyson","Try this—you always liked Sachertorte."],["Alyson","To welcome you, I even found a chef who knows the Helstota recipe. The man and the ingredients were flown in from Ovett."],["","Faced with such hospitality, Fia merely glances at the cake, showing no desire to taste it."],["Fia","No need. I find Doll Group pastries quite unpalatable."],["Fia","What you produce has neither flavor nor soul—just crude imitations piled high with industrial saccharin."],["Fia","They taste like the nouveau riche... cloyingly sweet."],["Fia","Save your false kindness, Alyson... I have nothing to offer you now."],["Alyson","It is only a tea gathering. There is no need to be so tense. I told you already—I simply wish to share some tea and sweets with you."],["Alyson","...Just as we did in the Principality of Ovett when we attended tea parties as children."],["","Before Fia can respond, the desserts and cutlery are already placed before her by the attendants behind her."],["","This is less a host receiving a guest than a king bestowing alms upon a subject—a silent declaration that refusal is not an option."],["Fia","Regrettably, those days are long gone."],["Fia","From the moment the Doll Group moved against the Helstota family, there has been nothing left for us to discuss."],["Fia","You not only seized my family's businesses through hostile acquisitions, but installed those useless puppets as Helstota's administrators..."],["Fia","And my exile to Milkhama Island—was that not yet another desperate attempt to wipe out the last of us?"],["","At the girl's refusal, Alyson's brow tightens slightly."],["Alyson","Let me make this clear. Everything done to the Helstota family was my bastard father's idea—and that of those idiotic shareholders. I never agreed to it."],["Alyson","Every grievance has its perpetrator, every debt its debtor. Please don't hate the wrong person."],["Fia","How high and mighty you sound. Before you say such things, why not think about who you are—the successor of the Doll Offshore Group, Alyson Doll."],["Fia","No matter how you try to distance yourself, you cannot cover up the atrocities the Doll Group has committed against Helstota."],["","The atmosphere in the room turns cold at once. For a time, the vast chamber falls utterly silent."],["","Only after a long moment does Alyson lift her teacup."],["Alyson","Alright, since you don't want to talk about the past, let's discuss the present."],["Alyson","The reason you came to this port... was to return to the Principality of Ovett, right?"],["Fia","......"],["","The fiery defiance in Fia fades at once, and she sinks quietly into her chair."],["","She can refuse Alyson's charity and resist Doll's ideas... but when it comes to returning home, she is powerless to argue."],["Alyson","I can't change the past, but I can change this—arranging a cruise to take you back in style is just a matter of words for me."],["Alyson","Well, for the sake of our past relationship, I don't mind throwing in a bonus... How about I just return the Helstota family's shares to you?"],["Alyson","After all, the assets I hold are already too hot to handle. One more or one less doesn't make a difference."],["","It is an extremely tempting offer. Every gift strikes directly at Fia's weakest point... so precisely that it sends a chill through her."],["Fia","And the price?"],["Fia","Father once said people from the Doll Group are like foxes on the frozen tundra—cunning and treacherous, forever chasing personal gain."],["Fia","You would never make a losing deal, Alyson."],["","Alyson gives a slight smile—the kind of anticipation unique to a hunter when her prey takes the bait."],["Alyson","Good. This is the Fia I remember... clever and decisive, yet still cautious."],["Alyson","As you said, in exchange, I need you to do something for me."],["Alyson","You might have noticed along the way that recently, the Doll Group has made a major deal on Milkhama."],["Alyson","Unfortunately, a pesky rat has set its sights on the group's shipment..."]],"560802101":[["Erisa","Hey there, this is Hansen Pizza Delivery. What would you like to order?"],["Information Dealer","The full Surf and Turf Platter combo, and a pear soda on the side."],["Erisa","Well, if it isn't our master of intelligence. Took you long enough to make contact."],["Erisa","So, how did it go? Any leads on that shipment I asked you to investigate?"],["Erisa","It's related to my special report, you know—it's super important!"],["Information Dealer","I've been watching for a whole week, and I finally got it figured out."],["Information Dealer","On the surface, the orders all come from ordinary up-and-coming companies, but in truth they share the same controlling shareholder behind the scenes—the Doll Group."],["Information Dealer","These guys are very cautious... The goods have been floating on the water for almost a month without touching land. They only started coming in this morning."],["Information Dealer","Look, right here, placed in the kind of port smugglers love most."],["Erisa","Ha... so that is why the earlier leads went cold. They were trying to slip it past us unnoticed... These capitalists are nothing if not cautious."],["Information Dealer","You do have a sense of danger, don't you? Do you even know how big a deal this stuff we're chasing is?!"],["Information Dealer","You told me at the start it was just a bunch of obsolete STs... and then what? Halfway through digging, I realize it's tied to those scientists from the UNCS!"],["Information Dealer","Messing with National Defense Force hardware—are you out of your mind? Do you know how tightly they're watching this stuff?"],["Information Dealer","The Doll Group's been letting this shipment bounce around the market just to dodge their eyes!"],["Erisa","Oh please, what's there to be scared of?"],["Erisa","Relax. If it were really top-secret, d'you think we'd have caught a whiff of it?"],["Erisa","Anyway, I pay—you do the job... works out nicely for both of us."],["","As if to put her colleague at ease, Erisa swipes her phone and settles the remaining payment in one smooth motion."],["Information Dealer","Hmph, that's more like it... Next time, give me some normal assignments."],["","Before the call even ends, Erisa is already flipping open the clue board on the table, buzzing with excitement."],["","The lines under her pen keep spreading outward, until a red circle forms around the Doll Group and the many forces surrounding it."],["Erisa","Logically speaking, these STs are just units scrapped from the \"Hyper-Aptamer Project.\" They're not supposed to have any commercial value."],["Erisa","And yet the Doll Group—expanding like mad across Milkhama Island—is willing to take that kind of risk just to buy a pile of rejects..."],["Erisa","This just keeps getting more interesting... Guess I'll head to the smuggling port and dig up the real answer myself."]],"560802301":[["","Once she confirms there are no UNCS pursuers behind her, Erisa heads straight back to her safe house and eagerly calls the information dealer."],["Information Dealer","How many times do I have to say it?! I don't wanna be involved with this shipment anymore!"],["Erisa","Hey, hey, hey—didn't I just dig up some new leads?"],["Erisa","Don't you wanna know why people from the UNCS are poking around the Doll Group's turf?"],["Information Dealer","I really don't!"],["Information Dealer","Just think of it this way—one side pulled a fast one and walked off with the goods, the other side thinks they got scammed and wants them back... boom, there's your story."],["Information Dealer","So why dig any deeper?!"],["","Erisa props her chin on her hand, thinking it over."],["Erisa","Because it's just so suspicious."],["Erisa","For the UNCS, these outdated STs shouldn't matter that much... no reason for them to chase this hard."],["Erisa","Lockdowns, trackers, the whole works... Hmph. There's definitely something shady behind all this."],["Information Dealer","And if that's the case, then I should definitely get out while I still can."],["Erisa","Why? How does that saying go? The greater the risk, the greater the reward?"],["Erisa","Think about it—if a secret like this hits the intel market, the hush money alone could keep you set for life."],["Erisa","Hey, relax. I'm not that interested in money. You can take all of it—I just wanna know the truth."],["Information Dealer","Hush money? I honestly can't tell if you're stupidly naive or naively stupid."],["Information Dealer","Let me spell it out. The UNCS and the Doll Group aren't fighting over a few outdated STs—they're after whatever's behind this shipment."],["Information Dealer","What exactly that is, I don't know. And frankly, I don't wanna know... Who knows how deep this rabbit hole goes..."],["Information Dealer","You might be ready to die, but I'm not! Either way, I'm not taking this job."],["Erisa","Ah... hung up. What a coward..."],["Erisa","Hmm. Still, he got one thing right. The UNCS and the Doll Group probably aren't after these piles of metal... they're after what's behind them."],["","Erisa pulls out the clue board. The red line under her pen runs back and forth between the UNCS and the Doll Group before finally stopping at a black box."],["Erisa","For example—\"Hyper-Aptamer Project.\""],["Erisa","Heh... this is way more exciting than I initially expected. This time, I might've really hooked a big fish."]],"560803101":[["Alyson","You might have noticed along the way that recently, the Doll Group has made a major deal on Milkhama."],["Alyson","Unfortunately, a pesky rat has set its sights on the batch of orders we just signed."],["Alyson","That rat has infiltrated the Doll Group by all sorts of means, illegally gathering evidence and publishing a flood of false reports."],["","Alyson waves a hand, and an electronic report appears before Fia."],["","From leaking company secrets to damaging group property... At a glance, the list is packed with cases tied to that reporter."],["Fia","That's... quite a list."],["Alyson","And now, this sensational reporter hasn't just trespassed into the group's storage depot—she's also infiltrated one of our confidential facilities."],["Alyson","If left unchecked, judging from past damage reports... she'll cause the group serious trouble."],["Alyson","Your task is to catch her and bring that little rat before me—in exchange for your ticket home and the Helstota family shares."],["Fia","From the way you describe it, she just sounds like a shady paparazzo. You're making a mountain out of a molehill."],["Fia","The Doll Group is powerful enough to treat companies and even nations as bargaining chips. Hard to believe you can't catch one petty thief."],["Alyson","Unfortunately, the Doll Group's situation on Milkhama isn't quite as omnipotent as you imagine."],["Alyson","From the moment they landed on the island, the UNCS's hostility towards the Doll Group has never ceased. Even now, they are contemplating how to devour our assets."],["Alyson","Just dealing with the lackeys surrounding Blair has already stretched our people thin."],["Alyson","And besides... that little rat isn't just some ordinary reporter."],["","Alyson snaps her fingers. The agent beside her understands immediately, quickly turning on the operation recorder in the room."],["Alyson","Her true identity is the same as yours..."],["Alyson","Both of you come from those shadowy laboratories run by the UNCS."],["","Light passes through the film, gradually bringing the image of the girl and her ST into focus on the screen."]],"560803301":[["","The combat record ends, the frame freezing on the final moment—the girl piloting her ST as she strides away into the distance."],["Alyson","Alright, that's all the footage... So tell me, do you still think she's just an ordinary reporter?"],["Alyson","Hmm, Fia?"],["","Fia stands beside her, still immersed in the footage. She stares at the screen, repeatedly rewinding and fast-forwarding the recording, as if confirming something."],["","Finally, the screen rewinds to the frame where the reporter leaps into the ST with a camera in hand."],["Fia","Erisa..."],["Alyson","It seems you and this reporter lady have some history I'm not aware of."],["","Watching the ponytail swaying on the electronic screen, memories flood back to Fia like a tide."],["Fia","We were not only test subjects—we came from the same laboratory... We endured the same suffering and witnessed the same tragedies."],["Fia","If it were not for Erisa... I would never have escaped that hell."],["Fia","Alyson, I appreciate your generosity, but I'm afraid I cannot accept this commission."],["Fia","I cannot... betray my friend."],["Alyson","Oh? So does that mean our relationship doesn't count as friendship in your eyes?"],["Alyson","Have you ever wondered why your journalist friend went from a fugitive test subject to a criminal trespasser causing trouble everywhere?"],["Fia","I... I don't know..."],["Fia","After we escaped the laboratory, I lost contact with Erisa completely... This is the first trace of her I have found in two years."],["Alyson","Lost contact, huh—"],["","Alyson rolls the phrase on her tongue with quiet amusement, a knowing smile spreading across her face."],["Alyson","The group's intelligence division has told me quite a few stories about those mysterious laboratories... including the escape two years ago."],["Alyson","It caused quite a stir, but most of the test subjects never actually got away. They were tracked down and recovered through various channels, then subjected to even more brutal experiments."],["Alyson","Drugs, surgery, modification... The researchers used every method imaginable to eliminate all resistance. Those who underwent a second round of alterations ended up as hollow puppets—no memories, no emotions."],["Alyson","As someone who lived through it, you should understand that better than anyone, Fia."],["Fia","Alyson, what exactly are you trying to say?!"],["Fia","Erisa could never become a puppet of the UNCS. Never..."],["","Alyson doesn't argue much, instead rewinding the footage to the segment where the Doll Group's STs are wantonly destroyed."],["Alyson","Unpredictable, uncommunicative, difficult to control... If you ask me, your friend is more like a weapon than a journalist."],["Alyson","Fia, can you guarantee that after two years apart, she is still the Erisa you knew?"],["Fia","I..."],["","Fia presses her lips tightly. As Alyson says, she can't make such a guarantee."],["Alyson","Of course, I won't force you to make a choice. You have the right to refuse."],["Alyson","However, if that's the case, I'll handle her in my own way."],["Alyson","You should know that your journalist friend's strength doesn't allow me to hold back."],["","Fia stares intently into Alyson's eyes, but in them she sees only unquestionable arrogance... There is no doubt Alyson is serious."],["","After hesitating for a long time, she finally speaks."],["Fia","That won't be necessary."],["Fia","I will accept the Doll Group's commission... I will investigate Erisa, and everything behind this, thoroughly."],["Fia","But until then, you must not take action."]],"560804101":[["Cold Voice","...Subject No. 14. Physical response ability failed to meet the required threshold. Medication support is required to continue the current test."],["Shrewd Voice","The dosage cannot be increased further. Given her physical condition, this is the limit."],["Cold Voice","...Use materials to merge Number 13's core with hers."],["","(It hurts... my head... it hurts so much...)"],["Shrewd Voice","Number 14 is experiencing abnormal heart rate due to brainwave response."],["Cold Voice","...Record the data and continue with the core merging."],["","Aaahhh—"],["Shrewd Voice","Subject 14 is experiencing a stress reaction. The merge cannot be maintained!"],["Cold Voice","...Increase the tranquilizer dosage. Continue the experiment."],["","The girl suddenly awakens."],["","The acrid smell of disinfectant and the sounds of medical equipment have faded away, replaced by the sensation of the cockpit."],["Fia","Was it a dream...?"],["Fia","So much time has passed, yet I still can't forget what happened back then..."],["","Her past in the laboratory is like a wound that has never healed. Whenever those memories surface, it aches faintly."],["","Drugs, surgeries, training—retain the qualified, remove the defective. Fia's days in the laboratory feel less like experiments and more like selection."],["","The researchers select those most suited to become weapons. Any act of resistance is treated as a potential threat—and a flaw."],["","Among those acts of defiance, the gravest is escape."],["","Once captured... memories erased, personality rewritten, turned into a living weapon that obeys without question. That is the only fate awaiting these subjects."],["Fia","Erisa, what exactly are you...?"],["","A sharp ringing from the bracelet cuts through her thoughts, pulling the girl back to reality."],["Alyson","Fia, why have your coordinates stopped moving? Did something happen?"],["Fia","No, I'm just... servicing my ST."],["Alyson","Still as transparent as ever, Fia... You always bite your lip when you lie."],["Alyson","You're thinking about Erisa again, aren't you?"],["Fia","......"],["Alyson","Don't worry, I won't do anything to your friend. My target has always been the same."],["Alyson","Invite your journalist friend to our tea party and find out which side she's on... and why she keeps biting at the Doll Group."],["Fia","No need for those high-sounding words. I'll do as you ask."],["Fia","Also, please... do not forget your promise to the Helstota family."],["Alyson","You should know very well—I'm not the kind of person who breaks promises."],["Alyson","By the way, as a friend, I have a piece of friendly advice for you."],["","As Alyson finishes speaking, the bracelet on Fia's wrist suddenly begins flashing red, like a warning."],["","With every pulse of light, the bracelet tightens and grows heavier, like a noose around her neck."],["Alyson","Don't even think about playing any tricks during the operation. If you betray my generosity..."],["Alyson","Very, very, very bad things will happen."],["Fia","Alyson, it's been so long... Your understanding of friendship has truly deepened."],["Alyson","This has nothing to do with friendship. It's merely a deposit."],["Alyson","As long as you complete the task, the bracelet will naturally be released in due time."],["Alyson","In any case, I await your good news. I trust you won't disappoint me, Fia Helstota."],["","Only when the bracelet finally dims does Fia breathe a sigh of relief."],["Fia","It's truly ironic, making such a choice to change my family's fate..."],["Fia","Yet in the end, I have become a tool for the true culprit."],["Fia","Father... Mother... What would you choose...?"]],"560804301":[["","In a daze, artillery fire illuminates the dim depot, as deafening eruptions and gunfire echo all around."],["","Amid the growing clamor, she faintly hears a familiar voice."],["","W-Wake up..."],["","Little Fia... Please wake up!"],["Fia","Did... did I pass out?"],["","Like a kite tugged by its string, the girl's consciousness wrenches itself free from the depths of chaos."],["","And the first scene she sees upon opening her eyes is the ST piloted by Erisa."],["","Despite being alone, the ST moves like a bolt of lightning, tearing through the UNSC's encirclement, preventing them from advancing even a step closer."],["Fia","Is that ST... Erisa?!"],["Fia","Didn't she lose her memory...? Why is she fighting against the UNCS?"],["Fia","What the... Ah!"],["","A thunderous roar interrupts Fia's confusion."],["","The pain sharpens her thoughts, and only then does she notice the old cargo platform has long been shattered by gunfire."],["","Hey, hey, Little Fia, you awake yet?"],["","If you can hear me, get moving!"],["","The platform below is about to give way—it could collapse any second, so hurry—"],["","I don't need you telling me something so obvious!"],["","Who are you...? Tell me!"],["","But the collapse comes faster than any reply. With a heavy crash, the ruins in her view begin to tilt."],["","Fia struggles to pull the control lever, but dust and debris spread everywhere as the floor beneath her feet starts collapsing piece by piece."],["","With nothing left to stand on, the ST begins to lose balance, sliding toward the broken edge."],["???","Fia, grab my hand!"],["","A silhouette flashes between the falling rocks and dust."],["","The plunging scene on the display suddenly freezes—the ST catches her mid-fall."],["Fia","Whoever you are... let go! The platform's already at its limit!"],["Fia","If you keep holding on, you'll also—"],["","The shattered platform can't bear the weight of two STs. After a violent tremor, churning metal echoes like a scream."],["","The steel bars supporting the platform completely break, and everything on the ST and platform plummets into the dust under the force of gravity."]],"560805101":[["","After what feels like an eternity, the sensation of falling finally fades."],["","But what follows is not the factory platform... but a stark white ceiling and the suffocating smell of disinfectant."],["","(It hurts... My whole body feels like it's being torn apart...)"],["","(Something heavy is pressing down on me... I can barely breathe...)"],["Shrewd Researcher","Number 14. Number 14, respond... Has she lost consciousness?"],["Fia","(That name... I know it. Number 14... my designation as a test subject...)"],["Cold Researcher","The instruments show the subject is still conscious... Administer a stimulant."],["Fia","Ah!! Ah... Ahhh..."],["","A sensation like an electric current sweeps through her body, followed by a sharp pain like a needle prick."],["","The researcher beside her remains unmoved. Only when the numbers on the screen finally stop fluctuating does she press the shutdown button with a sigh."],["Shrewd Researcher","Unfortunately, Subject 14's data still falls far short of the experimental targets and has failed to meet expectations."],["Shrewd Researcher","All this time with no results. Are you sure the compound isn't the problem?"],["Cold Researcher","Are you kidding?! The compound isn't the issue!"],["Cold Researcher","Check your own testing cycle. It's likely you people rushing things that's overloading the test subjects!"],["Shrewd Researcher","The higher-ups won't care about excuses. If the numbers still look like this at the end of the month... it won't end well for any of us!"],["Cold Researcher","Calm down. We still have other protocols available—like the core merge project. If I remember correctly, Subject 14 already passed the compatibility check."],["Shrewd Researcher","Yes. The data for samples 13 and 14 is nearly a perfect match... though the mortality rate for that experiment is extremely high. If it fails—"],["Cold Researcher","Hmph. They're just two lab rats. Even if something goes wrong, we'll write it off as an experimental accident."],["Fia","(Number 13...)"],["Fia","(Is that the one who's always talking about reports and news...?)"],["Cold Researcher","Someone clean up Area B immediately. We're about to start the experiment!"]],"560805301":[["","The endless experiment only halts when the experimental combat Puppets are finally exhausted."],["","For the sake of further observation, the researchers do not isolate Fia and Erisa as usual, but instead place them in the same lounge."],["Fia","Heavens... We finally made it through."],["Fia","Erisa, are you alright? Are you hurt anywhere—wait, why are you lying on the table?"],["Erisa","Wow! This lounge is so luxurious, there are even drinks and snacks in the drawer!"],["Erisa","Hmm... They're a month past the expiration date, but they should still be fine... Little Fia, want some?"],["Fia","......"],["","For a moment, Fia doesn't know how to deal with this outsider who seems completely oblivious to their situation."],["Fia","I really don't know whether to call you optimistic or oblivious... At this point, you still have the mood to eat?"],["Fia","If the experiment hadn't been suspended, what would be waiting for us wouldn't be this lounge—it would be the medical pods over there."],["Erisa","What's wrong? You can't work on an empty stomach."],["Erisa","Eat well now so you'll have the strength to play a few more rounds with these people later!"],["Erisa","Besides, I actually find this laboratory pretty interesting. It's not boring enough to make me lose my appetite."],["Fia","Interesting? What could possibly be interesting about this hellish place?"],["Erisa","I won't argue with the \"hellish\" part—but even hell has its own rules, doesn't it?"],["","Erisa props up her chin, her previous nonchalance completely gone."],["Erisa","That researcher with the icy voice looks calm, but the moment medication comes up, she gets more worked up than anyone. The one with glasses talks about data nonstop, but in reality, they're only concerned about their own performance."],["Erisa","These are just ordinary thoughts and desires, yet together they slowly build such a hell... Don't you find that fascinating?"],["Erisa","That's why I'm curious... Curious about what kind of ending awaits a place carrying so much ambition and obsession."],["","Fia looks at her in surprise. Her eyes are clear and bright, like a child filled with curiosity."],["Fia","I originally thought you were the kind of weakling who would crumble when things got tough."],["Fia","But now it seems..."],["Erisa","Hehe, I've been thinking about these lines for a long time, and today I finally have the chance to say them! Pretty cool, right?"],["Fia","...But now it seems, you're just a hopeless fool."],["Erisa","You really are awkward, Little Fia. Even your compliments come out all twisted."],["Erisa","Speaking of which, once we get out of here, want to be my assistant reporter, Little Fia?"],["Erisa","I'm planning to publish an exposé about these laboratories, and I could definitely use your help!"],["Fia","Thank you for your kindness, but this request... I cannot accept."],["Fia","I have a homeland I must return to... and things I must reclaim."],["Fia","Most importantly, I don't think we'll live to see the day we leave this place. The test subjects who came in with me are essentially nowhere to be seen..."],["Fia","I'm afraid that one day, I will also..."],["","Her voice grows quieter and quieter, until it fades into something like a sigh."],["Erisa","Really? I actually think the day we get our freedom isn't far off."],["Fia","...And why do you think that?"],["","Erisa pauses for a moment, but quickly returns to her usual playful demeanor."],["Erisa","No special reason. Just... intuition!"],["Fia","You're a strange person... but I'll take that intuition as a blessing."],["Fia","May we both walk into that future of freedom."],["","Fia politely says goodbye and quickly walks into her own lounge."],["","Erisa seems unfazed, still standing quietly and gazing out the window."],["","Chambers loading test subjects are delivered from all directions like bricks, continuously stacking and extending. From a distance, they resemble a precarious spire."],["Erisa","Trust me, Little Fia... when it comes to sniffing out trouble, my intuition's always spot on."],["Erisa","Milkhama... looks like it's about to rain."]],"560806101":[["Laboratory Guard","Requesting backup! Requesting backup! The defense squad has been ambushed and can no longer hold the line... Ugh!"],["","We did it... We did it! Everyone, head toward the laboratory!"],["","Those who've seized STs, follow me. Let's help Sylvia and the others break through!"],["Fia","The day Erisa spoke of has finally arrived..."],["","When Fia first heard the commotion, she thought it was just another ordinary experiment accident."],["","But soon, the alarms and explosions rose and fell like a tsunami sweeping through the entire laboratory."],["Fia","Strange... There's no sign of Erisa. Not among the breakout teams, not in the main hall..."],["Fia","Could it be she's still...?"],["","Fia heads toward Erisa's room. The heavy iron door stands half open, and faint sobbing can be heard from inside."],["Erisa","There, there... Your sister will be fine. Try to get some sleep."],["Erisa","I'll handle it from here."],["Erisa","Oh? Little Fia? Why are you still here? Did something happen?"],["Fia","Allow me to return the question—what are you doing here?"],["Fia","UNCS pursuers are on their way. If we don't move now, we won't make it out!"],["Erisa","Shh! Keep your voice down. You'll wake her."],["","Sister... Where did you go...?"],["Fia","What is this...? Why do you have a child with you?"],["Erisa","Uh... it's a bit complicated..."],["Erisa","This kid's sister was my last partner."],["Erisa","Every time an experiment ended, she would mutter the same thing. She said she was a burden to her sister and that no matter the cost, she had to find a way to get her out of here."],["Erisa","But the change came faster than she imagined. Drugs, surgery, modifications... Her sister, being so young, couldn't stand it. On the brink of mental breakdown, she chose to run away."],["Fia","As I remember it, that incident ended with every test subject being captured again."],["Erisa","Well, her sister, seeing that escape was impossible, finally hid back in her sister's room... To protect her, the big sister went straight to the researchers and took all responsibility for what happened. Including the punishment..."],["Fia","......"],["Erisa","In the end, before being dragged to the operating table, the big sister told me to take good care of her little sister..."],["Erisa","When you promise someone something, you have to keep your word. Don't you agree, Little Fia?"],["","Fia feels compelled to say something, but seeing the girl sleeping quietly in Erisa's arms, she can only sigh."],["Fia","To go this far for a promise... you really are a complete fool."],["Fia","I have only one request... Keep an eye on her, and don't alert the guards on the way."],["Erisa","Understood. I won't cause trouble for you, Little Fia."],["Fia","In any case, we had better get going right away."],["Fia","The test subjects who escaped earlier have paved the way for us. We'd better continue along their path."],["Fia","But those larger groups are long gone by now. We probably won't catch up with the rebels. The road ahead is up to us."]],"560806301":[["","In the smoke-filled laboratory corridor, the two STs move like dancers, one fast and one slow, intertwined in a deadly waltz."],["","Yet despite this, the pursuers behind them only increase, relentlessly chasing like hounds."],["Erisa","How do they keep coming? We've escaped this far—shouldn't they have given up by now!?"],["Erisa","If this keeps up, we're really going to... Ah!"],["","Before she can finish complaining, a sudden barrage of artillery pours into the corridor."],["Laboratory Guard","This is the semi-neural zone. Bio-signals from Test Subjects 13 and 14 have been detected!"],["Laboratory Guard","Only two enemy units. Team A and Team B, engage in rotation! No matter the cost, capture those escaped test subjects!"],["Erisa","Where did all these guards come from? Why are they everywhere?"],["Fia","Oh no, it seems the guards who were previously responsible for intercepting have returned!"],["Fia","If we get caught by them in this one-way passage... that's basically a death sentence."],["","For a moment, the communication channel falls silent, leaving only the sound of gunfire drawing closer."],["Erisa","Don't worry, Little Fia—I have another plan."],["","The words have barely left her lips as she flies into retreat."],["","The ST crosses the corridor, shooting like a meteor toward the area being blocked by the pursuing guards."],["Laboratory Guard","Wait, Number 13 has given up escaping and is rapidly approaching this way!"],["Laboratory Guard","She's trying to break through the blockade—stop her!"],["Fia","Erisa, what are you doing?! Don't do anything reckless!"],["Erisa","This isn't reckless. Didn't you say this is a one-way corridor with only one exit?"],["Erisa","So if I block the way, these guards won't be able to chase us, right?"],["Fia","What kind of plan is that?! Erisa, stop right now! I'm on my way!"],["Fia","Damn it... All the security doors in the corridor are locked. I can't open them!"],["Erisa","Forgot to mention, I smashed the door control panel earlier... It should buy you a little more time."],["Erisa","Little Fia, use that time to run."],["Fia","But if you do that, won't you be trapped!?"],["Fia","I... I don't want you to become a living weapon like the others!"],["","The girl's voice trembles continuously, gradually becoming choked with emotion."],["Erisa","It's okay. They can't catch me."],["Erisa","Besides... didn't you say you still had a home to return to and things to reclaim?"],["Erisa","After getting out... make sure you take care of everything, without regrets."],["Fia","Stop! Erisa—"],["","The further she advances, the more the communicator's voice became a blur. After making headway through several closures, only the crackling of static remains in her ears."],["Erisa","Alright, this distance should be enough for Little Fia to escape safely."],["Erisa","Next, let me add a special report."]],"560807101":[["","Her body feels heavy, as if filled with lead. Just opening her eyes nearly drains all her strength."],["","As her consciousness slowly clears, Fia catches a fleeting figure moving through the rubble and debris."],["","The figure stands by, as if recognizing her, saying something while reaching out a hand."],["","The moment she takes that hand, the name from Fia's memory overlaps."],["Fia","Eri... sa..."],["Erisa","Hmm? What is it?"],["","Looking at that familiar smile, Fia feels a subtle sense of disorientation."],["","She has seen many test subjects captured and brought back. Among them were people who were resolute, brave, and unyielding."],["","But in the end, without exception, they lost their memories and sanity during the second transformation... just like that child's sister."],["Erisa","Little Fia, say something, will you? The look on your face right now is really scary..."],["Erisa","It's like you've seen a ghost..."],["","But Erisa, standing here now, feels nothing like that at all. Instead, she seems so lively that... it's almost irritating."],["Fia","Erisa, weren't you already taken back and turned into a puppet of the UNCS?"],["Fia","Could it be... they've developed a new type of test subject capable of expressing emotions?"],["Erisa","Hey! Why are you still saying these weird things, Little Fia!? Keep that up and I really will get mad!"],["Erisa","If I'd really gone through all those ridiculous modifications and joined the UNCS, why would I come all the way here to rescue you!?"],["Fia","B-But if that's the case... why were you investigating that shipment before? And why did you attack the Doll Group's people?"],["Fia","Are you really still the Erisa I know...?"],["Erisa","That's because I'm investigating this batch of goods that the Doll Group got from the UNCS... It was fieldwork—a little friction is normal!"],["Erisa","As for why I fought them—"],["Erisa","That's because the Doll Group started it! When you actually believed their story, I figured explaining everything would be a hassle... so I just started fighting instead."],["Erisa","Anyway, I'm still me—the one and only Erisa! Everything that happened before was just acting!"],["Fia","You... you..."],["","Fia lowers her head, her voice trembling and hoarse."],["Fia","Do you have any idea how cruel that joke was?! I thought you'd turned into one of those test subjects... a puppet that had forgotten everything..."],["Fia","I almost believed... there was only one path left for us... just like that girl's sister..."],["","At the thought, the sorrow and regret she has been holding back finally break free, streaming down as tears."],["Erisa","H-Hey?! Little Fia, don't cry!"],["Erisa","W-We went through life and death together—how could I ever forget you!?"],["Erisa","I'm sorry, I was wrong, I was wrong! I won't make jokes like that again... Little Fia, just—"],["","Just then, a faint creaking sound echoes from nearby."],["Fia","Quiet."],["Erisa","...Mmm, mmm, mmm!"],["","Before she can wipe away her tears, Fia clamps a hand over her friend's mouth and half-drags, half-pulls her behind a crumbling wall."],["","The noise draws closer, until it becomes the heavy crunch of an ST trampling steel and concrete through the ruins."],["UNCS Soldier","Strange. There was a sound here just a moment ago... why'd it suddenly go quiet?"],["UNCS Soldier","They must be nearby. Search the area again!"],["","Only after the UNCS patrol moves off into the distance does Fia release her hand from Erisa's mouth."],["Fia","Catching up can wait... we need to deal with the problem in front of us first."]],"560807301":[["Fia","By the way, how did you escape the lab after that? I really thought you had already..."],["Erisa","Well... it wasn't nearly as dramatic as you think, Little Fia. When I doubled back, the lab was still in chaos. Hardly anyone stopped me on the way out."],["Erisa","I kept running... and then I ran into three ridiculously strong people. They tore through the place from one end to the other, turning everything upside down. The guards chasing me quickly got pulled away to deal with them."],["Erisa","After that, I just quietly followed behind them... and slipped out without much trouble."],["Erisa","But Little Fia, didn't you say you were heading back home? Why are you still here?"],["Fia","That's... a long story."],["","From the port to the Doll Group, from her family to Alyson, Fia recounts everything she has gone through. Watching the sky blush red, she feels a strange sense of relief."],["Erisa","I understand!"],["Erisa","So in the end, it all comes back to the Doll Group. Buying STs from the UNCS and sending you after me..."],["Erisa","You should stay far away from that heartless corporation. With schemes like these, that Alyson definitely isn't up to anything good!"],["Fia","It's already too late."],["","Fia pulls back her sleeve. The bracelet around her wrist glows a dangerous red, like a warning."],["Erisa","Huh? What's that thing?"],["Fia","A bracelet Alyson forced onto me. She warned me that if I betrayed her... something very unpleasant would happen."],["Fia","And she wasn't lying... whenever I even think about defying her, the bracelet tightens around my wrist."],["Erisa","This thing... probably isn't an ordinary bracelet."],["","Erisa takes Fia's wrist, studying the red light flashing from the bracelet. Her expression turns serious."],["Erisa","You've heard of this before, right, Little Fia? Plenty of companies and organizations keep leverage over their people to guarantee loyalty."],["Erisa","Family, power, secrets... anything goes. In short, it's a safeguard they can hold over your head to make sure you obey."],["Fia","And this bracelet... is the leverage Alyson placed on me."],["Erisa","Exactly. That ruthless woman isn't exactly the forgiving type. Whatever she put on your wrist is probably something like an explosive bracelet."],["Erisa","When it comes to threats, nothing works better than someone's life."],["Fia","......"],["","Fia's face flickers with shock. She bites her lip, struggling to suppress the unease rising inside her."],["Fia","The dye is cast. I've already signed a contract with Alyson... Even if this bracelet turns out to be a bomb, there's no turning back now."],["Fia","...According to our deal, Alyson will only let me go if I bring you—the one who caused all that chaos at the Doll Group—back to her."],["Fia","But now... I've come to understand something."],["Fia","Whether it's a ticket or my family, in the end, it's my own business... and has nothing to do with you, an outsider."],["Fia","Go, Erisa. Whatever grudges exist between me and the Doll Group... they're mine to face alone."],["","Fia lifts her head, gazing toward the distant, unreachable shore."],["Erisa","Hey, wait a second!"],["Erisa","Has it never crossed your mind, Fia... that what that young lady cares about might not be Erisa the \"freelance journalist,\" but Erisa the \"Hyper-Aptamer\"?"],["Fia","No. Alyson is ruthless, yes... but I don't think she'd go so far as to meddle with something like that."],["Erisa","Hmm. Hard to say. Personally, I think that young lady has had her eye on the Hyper-Aptamers for quite some time."],["Erisa","Think about it. Those tycoons went through all that trouble to come to Milkhama Island. Whether it's money or fame, they're after something."],["Erisa","And what did they get? Once they arrived, they had to endure pressure from the UNCS and keep the Dawnstar League satisfied. One way or another, they've been swallowing their frustration ever since."],["Erisa","If you were in their place, and you discovered something like the Hyper-Aptamers—a chance to leap ahead of everyone else—would you just let it slip away?"],["Fia","......"],["Erisa","No matter how you look at it, the Doll Group has had its fingerprints on every one of these incidents along our path."],["Erisa","More importantly... don't forget, Fia. You're a Hyper-Aptamer too."],["Erisa","If that young lady really came here for the Hyper-Aptamer Project, going back alone and empty-handed would be like sending a lamb to the slaughter, wouldn't it?"],["Fia","Even if you say so... I still can't agree."],["Fia","You've already helped me more than enough along the way. I won't drag you into any more danger."],["Erisa","Drag me into it? You're being awfully formal, Little Fia."],["","Erisa waves a hand and pulls a camera from her bag with a grin."],["Erisa","Don't forget—I'm the freelance journalist \"Ubiquitous Rain.\" Digging up details and uncovering the truth is my duty."],["Erisa","\"The Doll Group and the UNCS Involved in Illegal Experiments\"—a headline like that? How could I possibly stay away?"],["Fia","But even so, I can't really tie you up and deliver you to the Doll Group. We'll have to find a way to fool Alyson."],["Erisa","Then we'll put on a show—just like the one I used to trick you earlier, Little Fia!"],["Erisa","...But this time, the two of us will perform together!"]],"560808101":[["","Since the factory incident, the Doll Group's main office has been filled with tension and unease, like a dark sky before a storm."],["","And at the center of this storm sits Alyson herself."],["Alyson","Field Operations! Where is your accident investigation report?! My patience is limited. It's already been a full hour since the explosion at the company factory."],["Field Personnel","Miss, the destruction in the factory is such that a detailed accident report will take some time..."],["Field Personnel","We have currently only recovered the buried STs, which include both UNCS personnel and... our own."],["Alyson","...Are Fia and that reporter among the casualties?"],["Field Personnel","N-No! We've searched through most of the STs present, but we haven't found any trace of the two pilots."],["Alyson","Then keep digging! Even if you have to dig three feet deep, find me any trace of Fia!"],["Field Personnel","I-Immediately!"],["Alyson","Communications Department, is the tracking not debugged yet? Tell me the location of Fia's unit, now!"],["Communications Personnel","M-Miss, we've sent the transmitter signal multiple times, but we still can't locate Miss Fia's unit..."],["Alyson","Please tell me you're joking...! The ST Fia is piloting was specially prepared by the Doll Group. As long as she's on this island, it will leave a trace!"],["Communications Personnel","According to the report, the personnel on site detected traces of EMP. I'm afraid someone activated a jamming device, causing the locator to fail."],["Alyson","Tch. Another mess caused by those UNCS idiots... This time they've really made a foolish move."],["Alyson","Fine. If anything, this reminds me it's time to deal properly with Blair's little lackeys..."],["Alyson","Security Department, report the latest movements of the UNCS."],["Security Personnel","Miss, we were just about to contact you!"],["Security Personnel","The UNCS just conducted a raid on the Doll Group, claiming they are seizing the company under charges of \"illegal possession of private armed forces.\""],["Security Personnel","We were trying to negotiate with them... but they're being very heavy-handed. They've already forcibly seized several depots!"],["Alyson","Hmph. Those hyenas are even more impatient than I thought... Have the personnel on site withdraw. I'll handle this myself."],["Security Personnel","Got it!"],["","Just as Alyson prepares to leave, the silent communicator beside her crackles to life again."],["Field Personnel","M-Miss, important news... We've found traces of Miss Fia!"],["Field Personnel","The on-site personnel conducted a thorough search of the surrounding area and discovered an ST footprint leading outside. Upon comparison, the traces were found to be an exact match with the ST Miss Fia was piloting!"],["Field Personnel","Rest assured, we've already assembled a search team equipped with combat STs and missile artillery. This time, we'll definitely capture Miss Fia!"],["Alyson","Idiots! What do you think you're doing with all that firepower? Planning to blast Fia sky-high?!"],["Alyson","Remove all those lethal weapons. The search team is only allowed to deploy STs with minimal firepower!"],["Field Personnel","B-But Miss, didn't you say we should search every inch..."],["Alyson","I'll say it again! You're supposed to find her, not kill her!"],["Alyson","If you dare do anything unnecessary again... you can say goodbye to your position!"],["Field Personnel","Y-Yes, understood!"]],"560808301":[["","The Doll Group's search teams pursue the target along the coastline, eventually cornering them inside an abandoned facility."],["Doll Group Agent","Miss, I have a report. The security department has completed the deployment!"],["Doll Group Agent","All exits and escape routes are completely blocked. Aside from the main gate, there's no way out!"],["Doll Group Agent","Just give the order, and we can launch a full assault immediately!"],["Alyson","Well done."],["Alyson","Did you hear that, Fia? There's nowhere left for you to run."],["Alyson","I don't know why you're avoiding me. If it's a simple case of a mission going wrong, we can still work something out."],["Alyson","I can accept failure, but I absolutely cannot tolerate betrayal... Do not test my patience, Fia."],["","No. I've already completed your assignment."],["","Erisa... the reporter you wanted. I've brought her to you. She's inside."],["","The reason I did this... is because I want to talk."],["Alyson","Talk? Wasn't our agreement already written out in black and white? What exactly are you dissatisfied with?"],["","No... What I'm worried about is something else."],["","Alyson. Come alone. I'll be waiting in the deepest part of the warehouse."],["","The transmission ends, leaving only the faint beep of a terminated call lingering in the air."],["Doll Group Agent","Miss, the enemy is already at the end of their rope. They're in no position to negotiate with us!"],["Doll Group Agent","We can maintain our positions, tighten the perimeter step by step, and flush Miss Fia out with firepower!"],["Alyson","Stop! If we do that, how are we any different from those fools in the UNCS?"],["Alyson","Only the incompetent rely on brute force as their only solution."],["Alyson","Did you forget how the Doll Group established itself on this island? Assets, status, the family... We have plenty of ways to control a person."],["Doll Group Agent","Miss... Then what do you propose?"],["Alyson","Hold your positions. Fia isn't going anywhere."],["Alyson","She's a fish on a hook. As long as she still cares about her family, she won't be able to spit out the bait I prepared for her."],["Alyson","Fishing's always more interesting when the waters get rough... Fia, let's see just how long you can struggle."],["Alyson","Stay outside and await my orders... Don't do anything unnecessary."],["Doll Group Agent","Got it!"],["","With that, the young woman boards her ST and moves forward along the rusted machinery, heading straight for the coordinates her opponent sent."],["","The long-abandoned depot has somehow been cleared to form a path, and a vague figure stands deep within, waiting for her arrival."],["","But when the darkness fades, what appears before Alyson is an unexpected face."],["","What... It's you?!"],["Erisa","Just like Fia said... you really came alone, Miss Doll."]],"560809101":[["","Dusk hangs heavy over the scene. What was meant to be a quiet, secluded meeting place grows tense the moment Alyson and Erisa face each other."],["Alyson","Running, negotiating... I was wondering when Fia started playing such petty tricks."],["Alyson","Now it seems all those clever little schemes were yours, Erisa Shinohara."],["Erisa","Don't make it sound so bad. We fulfilled the promise in the call word for word—\"bringing the reporter to you.\""],["Erisa","As agreed, you should also follow the rules and sit down with us for a proper talk."],["","Alyson raises an eyebrow, her gaze sweeping the warehouse. Aside from herself and Erisa, there's no sign of a third person."],["Alyson","I'm curious then, if it's a negotiation, why didn't Fia come in person?"],["Erisa","The reason is simple—we don't trust you."],["Erisa","You had Little Fia come after me, claiming I'd gathered all those embarrassing secrets of yours... but who knows if you had other plans in mind?"],["Erisa","What if you turn on her the moment you get what you want, or worse—use that bracelet to threaten her? What would Little Fia do then?"],["Alyson","The bracelet? Don't mistake me for someone like you. I have no reason to stoop to something that low."],["Erisa","Who knows? Either way, I've handed over every secret about the Doll Group that I've uncovered along the way to Little Fia."],["Erisa","As long as you keep your promise, remove the bracelet, provide the ticket, and give her freedom... then everything will be fine, and Fia will naturally destroy the information afterward."],["","Before Erisa can finish, Alyson cuts her off with a displeased expression."],["Alyson","And what if I refuse?"],["Alyson","Erisa, don't forget—you're a wanted criminal. You're hardly in a position to bargain with me."],["Erisa","Oh dear, it seems our young lady hasn't figured out the situation yet..."],["","Just as Alyson is about to retort, a sharp alert suddenly crackles from the communicator at her waist."],["Doll Group Agent","M-Miss, emergency! The cargo incident the company suppressed earlier has resurfaced. Rumors are spreading like wildfire—reporters are already digging into it!"],["Alyson","Fool! Do I have to spell out even something this basic?"],["Alyson","Follow the contingency plan. Use PR to deal with insiders, and pay off anyone unfamiliar with the situation."],["Doll Group Agent","U-Understood, but... there's another matter we need to confirm with you, Miss. Regarding the upcoming press conference— which plan should we use for the setup and venue?"],["Alyson","What? What press conference?!"],["Doll Group Agent","The one about the cargo incident. Reporters outside are saying you'll personally host it to explain the situation. We couldn't find anything about it on the schedule, so we came to confirm with you."],["Alyson","What nonsense are you talking about? Why would I personally hold a press conference over something so trivial?!"],["Alyson","It's all rumors. There was never going to be any press conference. Clear those reporters out immediately!"],["","The moment the call ends, Alyson turns a sharp glare on Erisa."],["Alyson","Erisa... I suppose this is your doing as well?"],["Erisa","Hmm. I merely borrowed the Doll Group's communications channel for a moment. I didn't expect those reporters outside to take it so seriously..."],["Erisa","So, will the young lady really refuse to sit down and chat?"],["Erisa","If you keep refusing to cooperate, what gets exposed next won't be nearly this trivial."],["","A heavy silence falls between them. Only after a long, wordless standoff does the flawless calm on Alyson's face finally show a faint crack."],["Alyson","I truly underestimated you... using all this as leverage to bargain with me."],["Alyson","Care to hear my proposal?"],["Alyson","Erisa Shinohara, I must admit, I admire you. Digging up this much dirt on your own and throwing the entire company into chaos—someone like you would be valuable anywhere."],["Alyson","I can offer you a position as the Doll Group's public relations director, along with generous funding for your investigations. If you'd like, we could even launch a publication just for you."],["Alyson","And everything unpleasant that happened before? We can wipe the slate clean."],["Alyson","I just have one condition: tell me where Fia is."],["Alyson","Well? My offer is far better than the little deal you proposed, wouldn't you say?"],["Erisa","Hmm, indeed..."],["Erisa","If I accepted, I'd never have to haggle with information brokers again. I could upgrade my camera gear whenever I liked... maybe even renovate the office..."],["Erisa","Wait—no, no! That's not right! I'm here to negotiate for Fia!"],["Erisa","Nice try, but you can't buy me off with empty promises! Fia and I are friends! We've been to hell and back together... I'm not someone your heartless corporation can buy off!"],["Alyson","Friends...? Heh. That gives me an idea."],["","Something in Alyson's expression shifts, and her voice turns cold."],["Alyson","Security Department, raid the factory immediately—capture Erisa for me!"],["Erisa","Wait, what are you doing?!"],["Erisa","I-I'm warning you! Little Fia is still watching from outside. If you try to use force... the Doll Group's reputation will be finished!"],["Alyson","It doesn't matter. I can deal with the consequences. I simply find negotiating with you tedious... so I'd rather use more direct methods."],["Alyson","For example, first I'll take you back to the Doll Group, then tie you to a utility pole and starve you for three days and nights, and then broadcast your cries for help across Milkhama."],["Alyson","Knowing Fia, she would probably come begging in less than half a day."],["Alyson","After all... aren't you friends who have been to hell and back together?"],["Erisa","Haha, and now you're cracking jokes..."],["Erisa","Why would Little Fia ever do something like that for me? Come on, calm down—we can still talk this out..."],["Erisa","W-Wait! You're not serious, are you?!"],["","Erisa's pleas go ignored. Instead, the rumble of ST engines begins to rise around her, dark silhouettes gathering like storm clouds around the warehouse."],["","From Alyson's cold expression, Erisa reads the answer clearly—she is deadly serious."]],"560809301":[["Fia","Alyson, at this point I no longer expect anything from those so-called promises of yours."],["Fia","I only have one demand—remove the bracelet. Do that, and I'll put an end to those rumors."],["Alyson","The bracelet? That's what you're concerned about?"],["Fia","Then what else should I care about? Your shady dealings with the UNCS? Or those secret investigations you've been running on escaped test subjects?"],["","The severity on Alyson's face fades slightly, replaced instead with a trace of surprise."],["Alyson","Working with the UNCS? Those arrogant fools don't even bother acknowledging corporations like Obsidian. Why would they ever collaborate with newcomers like us?"],["Alyson","To them, the Doll Group is nothing more than a fat sheep in their pasture... and tell me, when have sheep ever had the chance to negotiate with wolves?"],["Alyson","If you refuse to take my word for it, at least take a look at this expense report."],["Alyson","One factory, three depots, and twenty-two STs destroyed in less than a day by the UNCS... some partnership that turned out to be."],["","Looking at the expense report filled with losses, Fia—who had been so certain until now—can't help but waver."],["Fia","In that case..."],["Fia","How do you know the secrets of those UNCS laboratories? And why did you go to such lengths to have me capture an escaped test subject like Erisa?"],["Fia","I don't believe those two things are unrelated... You must have some other purpose for me and test subjects like her."],["Alyson","Fia, you're very perceptive. It's true that I'm interested in test subjects—but that's where it ends. Mere curiosity."],["Alyson","You should know that the Doll family doesn't engage in unprofitable business... Experimental plans like those on Milkhama, with long cycles and high risks, have no investment value whatsoever."],["Alyson","Only someone with a broken mind would think of doing business in this mess."],["Alyson","Besides, even if I was stupid enough to get involved, I could just talk to Blair directly... What sense would it make to be chasing after the likes of you?"],["Fia","......"],["Fia","Then... what is it you're after?"],["Alyson","Alright, I've answered all your questions. Now it's your turn to answer mine—"],["Alyson","Did you and that Erisa put on this act just because of that bracelet?"],["","Now, all of Fia's former resolve is gone, her face clouded with hesitation."],["Fia","Be-Because... Erisa told me this was the insurance you prepared specifically for me..."],["Fia","A bracelet meant to threaten the wearer—one that would detonate the moment it detects betrayal..."],["","Before Fia can finish, Alyson has already burst into laughter."],["Fia","...Wh-What's so funny!"],["Alyson","Pff... haha... That is the most ridiculous thing I've heard in a long time..."],["Alyson","Fia, oh Fia... have you ever stopped to think—if that thing on your wrist were really a bomb, would you still be standing here talking to me?"],["Alyson","You don't actually see me as some kind of big bad villain pulling strings in the shadows, do you?"],["","Just as she finishes speaking, the bracelet on Fia's wrist beeps again. She looks down in confusion and notices something new on the electronic display."],["Fia","This is... an electronic ticket to the Principality of Ovett, and a share transfer agreement for Helstota?!"],["Fia","Alyson, you..."],["Alyson","Didn't I tell you? The bracelet is the \"deposit\" between you and me. What I promised was delivered to you from the very beginning."],["Alyson","Coming up with something as absurd as an explosive bracelet... honestly, your journalist friend might be better suited to filmmaking than reporting."],["Fia","Indeed. In retrospect, all these deductions started because of Erisa. I must confirm with her again... Huh, where is Erisa?"],["","The two of them glance toward where Erisa had been standing—but the little reporter has already vanished without a trace."],["Fia","......"],["Alyson","......"],["","The two of them look at each other, unsure of how to continue the conversation."],["Alyson","Your journalist friend is really something... She managed to play both of us."],["Fia","Miss Alyson... I'm sorry, I..."],["","Looking at the electronic ticket and contract on the bracelet, Fia's gaze drifts slightly, tinged with apology and guilt."],["Alyson","That expression doesn't suit you, Fia."],["Alyson","If you really feel bad, then consider what's in that bracelet as your reward. The process may have been messy, but in the end you drove back the UNCS and resolved the crisis."],["Alyson","Your actions proved something to me—you aren't some pitiful victim. You're an opponent worthy of being taken seriously."],["Alyson","We have a long future ahead of us, Fia Helstota."],["Erisa","So... that's the whole story?"],["Fia","That's right, Erisa... If it weren't for your embellishments, Alyson and I never would've ended up like that."],["Erisa","But, but it's not all my fault! I'm a victim too, you know... Ugh, it's all because that heartless heiress is so aggressive!"],["Erisa","I even brought out all the material I spent the last six months gathering while tracking the Doll Group to help you!"],["Erisa","And what happened in the end...? In less than a week, the Doll Group wiped out every backdoor and piece of dirt I had dug up—didn't even leave me a single photo!"],["Erisa","Now that heartless young lady's agents are everywhere... I can't even step out to buy a camera lens without running into a dozen people trying to arrest me!"],["Fia","Sounds like you brought this on yourself..."],["Fia","Forget it, everything is settled now. There's no point in dwelling on who's right or wrong."],["","As they talk, Erisa seems to realize something and tilts her head as she looks at Fia."],["Erisa","Wait a second—since everything ended well and that young lady kept her promise... why are you still in Milkhama, Little Fia?"],["Erisa","Shouldn't you be on a ship back home to enjoy your retirement?"],["Fia","Alyson did indeed keep her promise, but she's not the kind of person who grants every request."],["Fia","When she transferred the shares, she played a little word game. The contract named \"Alyson\" as the party, not \"The Doll Group.\""],["Fia","That means I only obtained the shares she personally held. If I want to fully reclaim the Helstota family business, I'll have to remain on the island and keep dealing with the Doll Group."],["","At this point, Fia's voice begins to falter slightly, as though she's trying to hide something."],["Fia","More importantly... the contract only mentioned shares, with no mention of cash anywhere..."],["Fia","Plus, I already spent all my money just to leave Milkhama... so..."],["","But before Fia can finish, her stomach lets out a loud growl."],["Erisa","So... you've been living hand-to-mouth, haven't you..."],["","Fia nodded awkwardly, without saying a word."],["Erisa","No worries! I've actually had an assistant reporter position open this whole time, just waiting for you to take it!"],["Erisa","Although... my account was frozen by that heartless heiress earlier, so I'm a bit short on cash right now. If you urgently need money, we'll have to think of another way!"],["Fia","Wh-What way?"],["Erisa","Online novels have been really popular in Milkhama lately. Fia, why not start by writing one?"],["Erisa","You could just adapt those diaries you write every day... I've even thought of a title for you: \"From Heiress to Helldriver: The Fall of a Noble House\"!"],["Erisa","You used to write in your diary every day back in the lab—your writing's so good, it's bound to become a hit!"],["Fia","Th-This kind of tasteless nonsense...? I absolutely refuse to write about it!"]]};
